{"hw":"ἐρέω1","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐρέω1</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐρέω</span> (A), <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> Verb, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = ἐρεείνω, ἔρομαι, ἐρωτάω, <b class=\"lex-tr\">ask, inquire,</b> c. acc. rei, <b class=\"lex-tr\">about</b> a thing, <span class=\"gk\">ἐρέων γενεήν τε τόκον τε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.128</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.31</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">seek for,</b> <span class=\"gk\">Ὕλαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.R.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.1354</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> c. acc. pers., <b class=\"lex-tr\">question,</b> <span class=\"gk\">μάντιν ἐρείομεν</span> (v. infr.) <span class=\"gk\">ἢ ἱερῆα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.62</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀλλήλους ἐρέοιμεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.192</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὅπως ἐρέοιμι ἑκάστην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.229</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> c. acc. rei, <b class=\"lex-tr\">search, explore,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἰλυούς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Nic.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">143</span> </span> ( v.l. ἐρέθοντες ). (Prob. <span class=\"gk\">ἐρε</span>(<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ϝ</span>)-, cf. <span class=\"gk\">ἐρευτής</span>: <span class=\"gk\">ἐρείομεν</span> perh. metri gr. for <span class=\"gk\">ἐρέ</span>(<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ϝ</span>) <span class=\"gk\">-ο-μεν,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">subj.</span> of non-thematic stem.)</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐρέω2</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐρέω</span> (B), <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> for <span class=\"gk\">ἐρῶ,</span> I <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">will say</b>; v. ἐρῶ. </div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐρέω3</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐρέω</span> (C), <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> for <span class=\"gk\">ἐράω</span> (A).</div>"}